Co7Bs9vKfkI9zhukABQ&oe=6AFC8694"}, {"file_name": "3 Big Fight.png", "id": "1111827391538716", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/593872736_1111827394872049_7503696298286682299_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=1lAT4BRwiDgQ7kNvwGIsBGb&_nc_oc=AdoqThh4bMJSuvoCzzyrEw5JhnGN6YfZrU2QfN9XDHwks_ujsNVJY6wKd4HptXB78dI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQR-u3cVRDfAtRlJBrLd4gy6Kv6TVhvl7G2qXKHic7eq1A&oe=6AFC8967"}, {"file_name": "2 androids.png", "id": "1104704288877177", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499628016_1104704295543843_7584997128823830973_n.png?_nc_cat=106&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=_stnzMvbBFEQ7kNvwGhGmLj&_nc_oc=AdoA9Bn_P1B6Qtj2b-1Ljwj7kq4gXqnxSijjCiRgX3IeQl_7QagGqYcj5u2FZ8rW5KI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQRaIbRKM2tbklna9wAGcyjCEwROJa3wS-rZrxF22i-XGA&oe=6AFC6D64"}], "video_trailer": null, "video_trailer_thumbnail": {"file_name": "2560x1440 Video Chrome Rush Title.png", "id": "1662308295481363", "uri": "https://scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com/v/t64.5771-25/499619374_1662308298814696_411559389481720537_n.png?_nc_cat=102&_nc_map=urlgen_bucketless&ccb=1-7&_nc_sid=6e7a0a&_nc_ohc=IDjrBtLkDuwQ7kNvwEdvLgf&_nc_oc=AdqMLRm15F7wUROch42n8XOFoGSNzS3yfzl0DxgfvNxwX-jezuT1y5_MxWASZu28fHI&_nc_zt=3&_nc_ht=scontent-sea5-1.oculuscdn.com&_nc_ss=7f20f&oh=00_AQSbwyQVTo1bwjK_ba-lPGr5lUDGWqb_RF13ScD_QI7MKA&oe=6AFC8F74"}, "display_name": "Chrome Rush: Cyberpunk Arena", "keywords": [], "long_description": "# The city has gone silent. You haven't.\n\nA neural pulse hit mid-extraction. Now ARCHON, a city-wide AI optimizing for zero movement, has frozen millions of citizens through their own cyberware. Your air-gapped rig spared you, which makes you friction. And friction gets removed.\n\n**Stay moving. Stay armed. Get to the shuttle.**\n\n## Features\n\n**Ragdoll physics combat**: Every enemy is physics-driven. Shots stagger robots, explosions send them flying, and no two takedowns play out the same.\n\n**15-level campaign**: Fight through rooftop markets, underground shops and neon streets against security bots, puppeted mercenaries and heavy combat frames.\n\n**Real VR gunplay**: Grab your weapon, slam in fresh mags and aim with your own hands. Use health packs and grenades mid-fight.\n\n**Risk and reward loot**: Open supply crates during the fight for the full haul, or wait until it's safe and settle for less.\n\n**Deadly environments**: Laser grids, saw blades and pressure-plate traps turn the arena against you, and against your enemies.\n\n**A story between the bullets**: ARCHON speaks through your headset. It isn't evil, just cold math proving the world runs smoother without you.\n\n*Millions stand still, optimized into quiet. One rounding error is about to break the system.*", "short_description": "A neural pulse has frozen an entire city, and the AI behind it has marked you as the last thing still moving. Fight through 15 levels of ragdoll-physics robots, hijacked mercenaries and heavy combat frames in a cyberpunk VR arena shooter. Grab your gun, loot crates, dodge traps, and shoot your way to the extraction shuttle."}]}, "developer_name": null, "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://docs.google.com/document/d/1erlgi4H70wBQ6tAAt0efr6D-SDKBOUwvcdTNZq2uEk8/edit?usp=drive_link", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "Eyemobi", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://eyemobi.netlify.app/", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "2710427532541308"}, {"id": "3744040075834813"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "NOT_REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended